 "insight": [
  "Luxembourg's exports to Belgium, Germany, France, and Spain show varied trends from 2005 to 2025 every five years.",
  "Exports to Belgium increased by 54.2 %, from 1.39 billion euros in 2005 to 2.14 billion euros in 2025, peaking at 2.57 billion euros in 2015.",
  "Exports to Germany rose by 27.2 %, from 3.08 billion euros in 2005 to 3.91 billion euros in 2025, with a peak of 4.24 billion euros in 2022.",
  "Exports to Spain decreased by 58.6 %, from 1.23 billion euros in 2005 to 511.1 million euros in 2025, while exports to France increased by 16.4 %, reaching their peak of 3.10 billion euros in 2025.",
  "The data are in current euros and include 2.8 % of trade with undisclosed partners, which are not ranked by country."
 ],
